# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# ─── TURN 38 (CLAUDE.md F10): a DXF proof keeps the line endings it was written
# with. `cnc/dxf.js` emits CRLF because that is what AutoCAD itself emits and
# what VCarve is known to import; a proof artefact normalised to LF would be a
# picture of a file the app never wrote.
*.dxf -text
